---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "How Did We Do? | The Café"
description: "Tell The Café in Leavenworth, KS how we did: a two-minute survey about the food, the service and what to add to the menu."
pageCss: "/assets/css/survey.css"
noindex: true
---
<!-- The customer survey, reached from the QR on the counter sign
     (studio/sign-survey) and the paper card. Unlisted: off the nav and the
     sitemap, noindex, because it's for people who were just here.

     The questions live in src/_data/survey.json, shared with the printed
     card, so the paper and the page always ask the same thing. Answers go
     by email through Formspree (site.survey.formUrl); every question is
     optional, so a half-finished survey still sends what it has. Name and
     contact are asked for only if the customer wants a reply. -->

        <section class="section" aria-labelledby="survey-heading">
            <div class="container survey">
                <h1 id="survey-heading">How did we do?</h1>
                <p class="survey-intro">
                    Two minutes, and every question is optional. We read every one.
                </p>

                <form action="{{ site.survey.formUrl }}" method="POST" novalidate
                      data-success="Thank you! We read every survey, and yours helps us get better.">

                    <!-- honeypot: humans never see or fill this -->
                    <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"
                           style="position:absolute; left:-9999px;" aria-hidden="true">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Customer survey">

                    <div class="form-grid">

                        {%- for q in survey.ratings %}
                        <fieldset class="rate">
                            <legend>{{ q.label }}</legend>
                            <div class="pills">
                                {%- for opt in survey.scale %}
                                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="{{ q.name }}" value="{{ opt }}"><span>{{ opt }}</span></label>
                                {%- endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>
                        {%- endfor %}

                        {%- for q in survey.choices %}
                        <fieldset class="rate">
                            <legend>{{ q.label }}</legend>
                            <div class="pills pills--wrap">
                                {%- for opt in q.options %}
                                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="{{ q.name }}" value="{{ opt }}"><span>{{ opt }}</span></label>
                                {%- endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>
                        {%- endfor %}

                        {%- for q in survey.open %}
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="{{ q.name }}">{{ q.label }}</label>
                            <textarea id="{{ q.name }}" name="{{ q.name }}" rows="3"></textarea>
                        </div>
                        {%- endfor %}

                        <fieldset class="reply">
                            <legend>Want us to get back to you? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></legend>
                            <div class="reply-fields">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="name">Name</label>
                                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name">
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="contact">Phone or email</label>
                                    <input type="text" id="contact" name="contact" autocomplete="email">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>

                        <div class="form-submit">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send</button>
                            <p class="form-privacy">
                                We only use your answers to improve the cafe, and your contact details only to reply.
                                See our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
